{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "There's a town in America with a population of one.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.037
  },
  {
   "text": "Her name is Elsie.",
   "start": 3.579,
   "end": 4.817
  },
  {
   "text": "Monowi, Nebraska once had over a hundred people.",
   "start": 5.373,
   "end": 8.244
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the shops closed.",
   "start": 8.84,
   "end": 9.93
  },
  {
   "text": "The schools merged.",
   "start": 10.32,
   "end": 11.19
  },
  {
   "text": "People left.",
   "start": 11.72,
   "end": 12.28
  },
  {
   "text": "By the year two thousand, only two were left:",
   "start": 12.947,
   "end": 15.938
  },
  {
   "text": "Elsie and her husband, Rudy.",
   "start": 15.938,
   "end": 17.51
  },
  {
   "text": "In two thousand four, Rudy died.",
   "start": 18.129,
   "end": 20.06
  },
  {
   "text": "So Elsie became the mayor.",
   "start": 20.53,
   "end": 22.27
  },
  {
   "text": "And the clerk.",
   "start": 22.75,
   "end": 23.37
  },
  {
   "text": "And the treasurer.",
   "start": 23.67,
   "end": 24.44
  },
  {
   "text": "And the librarian.",
   "start": 24.73,
   "end": 25.73
  },
  {
   "text": "And the bartender.",
   "start": 25.97,
   "end": 27.02
  },
  {
   "text": "Every year, she issues herself a liquor licence",
   "start": 27.564,
   "end": 30.628
  },
  {
   "text": "and signs it.",
   "start": 30.56,
   "end": 31.24
  },
  {
   "text": "Every election, she votes for herself.",
   "start": 31.856,
   "end": 33.85
  },
  {
   "text": "Rudy loved books.",
   "start": 34.571,
   "end": 35.527
  },
  {
   "text": "His last wish was a public library.",
   "start": 35.527,
   "end": 38.133
  },
  {
   "text": "So Elsie opened one:",
   "start": 38.78,
   "end": 40.96
  },
  {
   "text": "five thousand books, open to anyone.",
   "start": 41.1,
   "end": 43.01
  },
  {
   "text": "And she kept the tavern open.",
   "start": 43.548,
   "end": 44.854
  },
  {
   "text": "People drive up to eighty miles just to sit at her bar.",
   "start": 45.28,
   "end": 49.45
  },
  {
   "text": "Population:",
   "start": 49.87,
   "end": 50.5
  },
  {
   "text": "one.",
   "start": 50.62,
   "end": 50.9
  },
  {
   "text": "But never alone.",
   "start": 50.9,
   "end": 51.73
  },
  {
   "text": "Not everyone has a tavern full of friends down the road.",
   "start": 52.317,
   "end": 54.946
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why we made Feeloy.",
   "start": 55.348,
   "end": 56.9
  },
  {
   "text": "Jenny is always there, remembers your story,",
   "start": 57.31,
   "end": 59.91
  },
  {
   "text": "and keeps the door open, day and night.",
   "start": 60.06,
   "end": 62.07
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 62.585,
   "end": 64.013
  }
 ]
}